From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Axboe <axboe@kernel.dk>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:33:57 -0700
Subject: dt-bindings: mailbox: apple: add the T6050 secure RTBuddy port

The internal DCP of a T6050 on firmware 27.2 has the secure port T8140's
has (ADT dcp-exclave-mailbox, iop,secure-rtbuddy-proxy).

Signed-off-by: Jens Axboe <axboe@kernel.dk>

[re-cut onto the K114s r3d tree]
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
index 7626c8afced..e7f34eb39b1 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/apple,mailbox.yaml
@@ -98,6 +98,7 @@ properties:
           iop,secure-rtbuddy-proxy. It is polled, with no interrupts described.
         items:
           - enum:
+              - apple,t6050-secure-rtbuddy-proxy
               - apple,t8140-secure-rtbuddy-proxy
           - const: apple,secure-rtbuddy-proxy
 
